**W002** · Unreferenced type

type 'Payload' is not referenced by any behavior, port, or type

A `type` entity has no incoming references from any `behavior`, `port`, or other `type`. Reference the type where it's used, or remove it if it's dead.

[Documentation](https://github.com/leaderiop/SpecForge/blob/main/docs/diagnostics.md#w002)

